Package: mirrorman
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pkexec, dbus, apt
Recommends: mirrorman-cli
Description: Debian mirror and repository manager
 MirrorMan is a GTK4 / Libadwaita mirror and repository management application
 for Debian GNU/Linux and Persis OS. It tests Debian mirrors for latency and
 speed, provides Iran domestic mirrors, edits APT configuration, and manages
 standard and third-party repositories.

Package: mirrorman-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus, apt
Description: Debian mirror and repository manager CLI
 Headless command-line interface for MirrorMan, allowing automatic speed
 benchmarking, ranking, and synchronization of Debian mirrors and repositories.
